## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates real-time, tenant-isolated data drift detection and automated model retraining capabilities—a critical production challenge at scale.

## Key Concepts
- Real-time streaming with multi-region Dataflow
- Per-tenant isolation in BigQuery
- Data Catalog lineage tracking
- Vertex AI automated retraining triggers
- Drift metrics: distribution shifts and Kolmogorov-Smirnov tests

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: evaluate drift score and trigger retraining
function evaluateDriftAndRetrain(tenantId, driftScore, threshold) {
  if (driftScore > threshold) {
    triggerVertexAIRetraining(tenantId);
  }
}
```

## Why This Is Asked

Assess data quality at ingestion and the practicality of dead-letter routing in a real pipeline.

## Key Concepts

- Data quality at ingestion
- Side outputs / dead-letter routing
- Type coercion and validation
- Beam/Dataflow to BigQuery integration
- Monitoring

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo Beam DoFn for ingestion validation
function processElement(element) {
  let obj;
  try { obj = JSON.parse(element); } catch (e) { return {error: 'invalid_json'}; }
  if (!obj.user_id || !obj.event_type) return {error: 'missing_fields'};
  const amount = parseFloat(obj.amount);
  if (Number.isNaN(amount)) return {error: 'invalid_amount'};
  return {user_id: obj.user_id, event_type: obj.event_type, amount: amount};
}
```

